    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d462">

                <pb facs="0743" n="641" sameAs="frus:frus1933v01/pg641"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">550.S1/960: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chairman of the American Delegation</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Hull</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting
                        Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-06-15T14:00:00+01:00">June 15, 1933—2
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received June 15—8:25 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>32. For the President and Phillips. We have won the first fight. Bonnet himself
                    will tonight nominate Cox as Chairman of the Monetary Commission.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
